1 NOTE GENERATION 2 FAMILY (1858-1903). Martinus van Duijnhoven (18 Dec 1829 - 18 Jul 1903) x Geertruda Verwegen (1833 - ~1900). Large Catholic family typical of rural Noord-Brabant. CORRECTION: Petrus Cornelus (@I046@) was incorrectly listed here - he is from a different Martinus van Duijnhoven × Elisabeth van Schijndel. The actual son Petrus van Duijnhoven (@I352@) married Megchelina Verwegen 1904, confirmed by 1942 death record listing parents. Confirmed children: Lambertus (1861, @I166@), Maria (1864, @I044@), Antonius (1865, @I045@), Petrus (~1870, @I352@), Petronella (1869, @I047@), Johanna (died young ~1870, @I048@), and MARIANUS (24 Apr 1872, @I005@) — our direct ancestor. The Verwegen-Van Duijnhoven connection was a double bond: Geertruda's sister Ardina married Martinus's brother Johannes in 1856. Geertruda predeceased Martinus by ~3 years; he died 18 Jul 1903 at age 73.

