1 NOTE Ninth child, sixth son. Married Wilhelmina Petronella van Creij 26 Oct 1948 in Nistelrode - just three years after liberation and in the same year as brother Johan's emigration preparations. His wedding in 1948 came during the post-war recovery period when the Netherlands was rebuilding with Marshall Plan aid and Dutch families were resuming normal life after five years of German occupation. Antonius chose a bride from nearby Nistelrode (10 km from Uden), typical of the close-knit Brabant Catholic marriage networks. His nickname 'Toon' is the standard Dutch diminutive of Antonius.
