1 NOTE Dutch collateral branch. Lambertus van Duijnhoven (1861-1932) was an uncle of Johan van Duijnhoven (the emigrant, Gen 4). Son of Martinus van Duijnhoven (Gen2, 1829-1903, @I003@) x Geertruda Verwegen (@I004@). Born 1861, predates known siblings Maria (1864), Antonius (1865). Brother of Marianus (Gen3, 1872, @I005@). His descendants are Dutch 2nd cousins of Arthur van Duynhoven. Had 11 children, 7 survived to adulthood: Adriana (1898-1983), Geertruda (1901-1978), Martina (1903-1990), Francisca (1904-1961), Petrus Johannes (1908-1975, had 5 children), Johanna (1911-1984), Martinus (1912-1992). The Lambertus branch remained entirely in Uden/Brabant. Source: Teunissen genealogy tree (genealogieonline.nl).
