1 NOTE Father of Franciscus van der Horst, who married Catharina Huberti van den Elsen on 21 Apr 1792 in Boekel. The patronymic 'Wilhelmi' in Franciscus's 1792 marriage record confirms his father's name. Franciscus's son Hubertus van der Horst married Ida Dapperen, and their daughter Francijna married Johannes van den Elzen — making Wilhelmus the great-great-grandfather of Anna Maria van den Elzen (Gen 3 wife of Marianus van Duijnhoven). Source: FRANCIJNA_MECHELINA_PARENTS.md 2026.
