1 NOTE Mother of Hendricus Johannes Wassenberg (@I041@). Named as groom's mother in 1946 Uden marriage akte bhi:3132f6e9. Married Hendricus Wassenberg 12 Feb 1909 in Uden (marriage akte bhi:9060aa0f-0679-1911-2631-a2b4be0120bc). KINSHIP CONFIRMED: she is the daughter of Hendricus van Duijnhoven (1837-1910, @I053@) and Anna Maria van der Wijst (their marriage: bhi:6e97dead-495c-43d2-bafe-8b172cd57263, Uden 16 Jun 1866). Hendricus (1837) was the BROTHER of Martinus (1829, @I003@), so Johanna is a FIRST COUSIN of Marianus (@I005@). This makes her son Hendricus Johannes Wassenberg and his bride Hendrica Maria 'Riek' van Duijnhoven (@I018@) SECOND COUSINS - a confirmed endogamous marriage within the van Duijnhoven line. Both are great-grandchildren of Gen 1 patriarch Petrus van Duijnhoven (1799-1882) x Johanna van der Heijden. See research/WASSENBERG_VD_CONNECTION.md.  Birth confirmed: born 12 Mar 1875 Uden, akte Uden 29/1875 (OpenArchieven bhi:8850fac1-9be3-ace5-ae04-3a35a4d43d94); one of 8 children of @I053@ x @I411@.
